    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Our Editor\r\n\r\nThis is Web Lab 2 - a tool we'll be using to make websites. This level is all about exploring how this tool works.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n- Ask AI Tutor \"How is this site coded?\"\r\n- Switch between different files in the project (for example: view the `vision.txt` file)\r\n- Highlight a line of code and click \"Add to AI Tutor Chat\", then ask AI Tutor to explain it\r\n- Change a word in the code editor so it also changes something in the preview\r\n- Resize one of the panels to make the workspace bigger or smaller\r\n- Make the preview \"full screen\"\r\n\r\nOnce you've completed most of these tasks, press Continue to go to the next level.\r\n\r\n**Challenge:** This website has a _bug_ in the last part of the website. Use AI Tutor to help you find the bug and see if you can fix it!",
